type: software
title: "Hot-Air Balloon Flight Ops CLI built with Pixeltable"
abstract: "Hot-air balloon flight log CLI: idempotent batch imports keyed by content hashes, computed burn/propane/payload columns, pxt revert and pxt rename for recovery, and a fingerprint command that rebuilds the cloud deploy fingerprint with Pixeltable's public hashing helpers."
